// --- Slot Assignments ---
//@arg cpm_slot_translation string 번역 보조 모델
//@arg cpm_slot_emotion string 감정 보조 모델
//@arg cpm_slot_memory string 메모리 보조 모델
//@arg cpm_slot_other string 기타(유틸) 보조 모델
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans string 컵케익 번역기 모델

// --- Slot Prefill (Assistant Role — 슬롯 마지막에 어시스턴트 롤로 삽입) ---
//@arg cpm_slot_translation_prefill string 번역 슬롯 프리필 (어시스턴트 롤)
//@arg cpm_slot_emotion_prefill string 감정 슬롯 프리필 (어시스턴트 롤)
//@arg cpm_slot_memory_prefill string 메모리 슬롯 프리필 (어시스턴트 롤)
//@arg cpm_slot_other_prefill string 기타 슬롯 프리필 (어시스턴트 롤, 루아/트리거)
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_prefill string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 프리필 (어시스턴트 롤)
//@arg cpm_slot_translation_streaming string 번역 슬롯 스트리밍 오버라이드 (inherit/off/stream/buffered, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_translation_buffered_streaming string 번역 슬롯 한번에 받기 레거시 오버라이드 (마이그레이션 전용)
//@arg cpm_slot_translation_repetition_guard string 번역 슬롯 반복 감지 오버라이드 (inherit/on/off, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_translation_reasoning_continuation string 번역 슬롯 숨은 추론 상태 이어받기 오버라이드 (on/off/inherit, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_emotion_streaming string 감정 슬롯 스트리밍 오버라이드 (inherit/off/stream/buffered, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_emotion_buffered_streaming string 감정 슬롯 한번에 받기 레거시 오버라이드 (마이그레이션 전용)
//@arg cpm_slot_emotion_repetition_guard string 감정 슬롯 반복 감지 오버라이드 (inherit/on/off, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_emotion_reasoning_continuation string 감정 슬롯 숨은 추론 상태 이어받기 오버라이드 (on/off/inherit, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_memory_streaming string 메모리 슬롯 스트리밍 오버라이드 (inherit/off/stream/buffered, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_memory_buffered_streaming string 메모리 슬롯 한번에 받기 레거시 오버라이드 (마이그레이션 전용)
//@arg cpm_slot_memory_repetition_guard string 메모리 슬롯 반복 감지 오버라이드 (inherit/on/off, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_memory_reasoning_continuation string 메모리 슬롯 숨은 추론 상태 이어받기 오버라이드 (on/off/inherit, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_other_streaming string 기타 슬롯 스트리밍 오버라이드 (inherit/off/stream/buffered, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_other_buffered_streaming string 기타 슬롯 한번에 받기 레거시 오버라이드 (마이그레이션 전용)
//@arg cpm_slot_other_repetition_guard string 기타 슬롯 반복 감지 오버라이드 (inherit/on/off, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_other_reasoning_continuation string 기타 슬롯 숨은 추론 상태 이어받기 오버라이드 (on/off/inherit, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_streaming string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 스트리밍 오버라이드 (inherit/off/stream/buffered, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_buffered_streaming string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 한번에 받기 레거시 오버라이드 (마이그레이션 전용)
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_repetition_guard string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 반복 감지 오버라이드 (inherit/on/off, default inherit)
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_reasoning_continuation string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 숨은 추론 상태 이어받기 오버라이드 (on/off/inherit, default inherit)

// --- Global Streaming Repetition Guard ---
//@arg cpm_repetition_guard_enabled string Stop streaming generation when repetition is detected (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_repetition_guard_character_repeat_threshold string Identical-character repetition threshold
//@arg cpm_repetition_guard_min_pattern_repeats string Minimum repeated-pattern count
//@arg cpm_repetition_guard_min_repeated_chars string Minimum repeated-pattern span in characters
//@arg cpm_slot_translation_service_tier string 번역 슬롯 서비스 티어 (inherit/auto/flex/default)
//@arg cpm_slot_emotion_service_tier string 감정 슬롯 서비스 티어 (inherit/auto/flex/default)
//@arg cpm_slot_memory_service_tier string 메모리 슬롯 서비스 티어 (inherit/auto/flex/default)
//@arg cpm_slot_other_service_tier string 기타 슬롯 서비스 티어 (inherit/auto/flex/default)
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_service_tier string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 서비스 티어 (inherit/auto/flex/default)
//@arg cpm_slot_translation_caching string 번역 슬롯 캐싱 (inherit/off/on/extended)
//@arg cpm_slot_emotion_caching string 감정 슬롯 캐싱 (inherit/off/on/extended)
//@arg cpm_slot_memory_caching string 메모리 슬롯 캐싱 (inherit/off/on/extended)
//@arg cpm_slot_other_caching string 기타 슬롯 캐싱 (inherit/off/on/extended)
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_caching string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 캐싱 (inherit/off/on/extended)

// --- Cupcake Translator Slot Generation Parameters ---
// Declared explicitly (unlike the legacy translation/emotion/memory/other slots) so the
// values survive a plugin update through RisuAI's own argument record, not only SettingsBackup.
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_max_context string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 최대 컨텍스트 토큰
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_max_out string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 최대 응답 토큰
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_temp string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Temperature
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_top_p string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Top P
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_top_k string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Top K
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_rep_pen string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Repetition Penalty
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_freq_pen string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Frequency Penalty
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_pres_pen string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Presence Penalty
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_thinking string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Thinking Level
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_thinking_budget string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Thinking Budget
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_reasoning string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Reasoning
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_verbosity string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Verbosity
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_effort string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 Reasoning Effort
//@arg cpm_slot_cupcaketrans_adaptive_thinking string 컵케익 번역기 슬롯 적응형 사고 (true/false, default false)

// --- Separated Aux Model Routing ---
//@arg cpm_aux_routing_enabled string Enable separated aux model routing (true/false)
//@arg cpm_aux_routing_config string Separated aux model routing config JSON
//@arg cpm_aux_routing_allow_tools string Allow tool-use loop inside aux-routed parallel calls (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_aux_routing_debug string Store bounded aux routing runtime diagnostics (true/false)

// --- C-Mind Embedding Sub-Plugin (IPC) ---
//@arg cpm_cmind_enabled string Enable C-Mind embedding sub-plugin integration (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_cmind_embed_url string C-Mind embedding endpoint (OpenAI-compatible /embeddings)
//@arg cpm_cmind_embed_key string C-Mind embedding API key
//@arg cpm_cmind_embed_model string C-Mind embedding model id

// --- Cupcake Translator (🧁 [CPM] 번역기 virtual model) ---
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_enabled string Enable the Cupcake Translator built-in component (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_new_only string Translate only the newest resolved response (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_skip_user string Skip user-authored messages during translation (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_protection string Protect structural markup (code/HTML/asset) with tokens during translation (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_delimiters string Source-delimiter list; one entry per line, either a tag name or "open | close" literals (default source + Sample_Text, case-insensitive; "off" disables)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_strip_delims string Remove leaked source-delimiter strings from the translated response (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_glossary string Inject the glossary lorebook as a <glossary> block (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_guide string Inject the translation-guide lorebook as a <translation-guide> block (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_extra_protect string Feed the extra-protection lorebook lines into the protection pattern table (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_glossary_name string Glossary lorebook name, matched case-insensitively against the entry comment (default CPM_번역_용어집)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_guide_name string Translation-guide lorebook name, matched case-insensitively against the entry comment (default CPM_번역_가이드)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_protect_name string Extra-protection lorebook name, matched case-insensitively against the entry comment (default CPM_번역_보호)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_dup_mode string How duplicate lorebook names are handled (first/all, default first)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_max_bytes string Byte ceiling for the injected reference blocks (default 8192, minimum 256)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_history string Inject previous source/translation pairs as a <history> block (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_history_turns string How many previous translated turns to quote (1-20, default 2)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_history_bytes string Byte ceiling for the history block; oldest pairs are dropped first (default 4096, minimum 128)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_replacer string Also apply the translator pipeline when the RisuAI translate slot uses a normal model (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_bridge string Let 🧁CPM_모듈 evaluate the CBS written in the reference lorebooks and hand the values back (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_cupcake_trans_bridge_name string Variable-bridge lorebook name holding the `key = CBS` map, matched case-insensitively (default CPM_변수전달)

// --- Provider Enable Toggles ---
//@arg cpm_enable_vertex string Enable Vertex AI Provider (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_gemini string Enable Gemini Studio Provider (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_openai string Enable OpenAI Provider (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_anthropic string Enable Anthropic Provider (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_deepseek string Enable DeepSeek Provider (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_openrouter string Enable OpenRouter Provider (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_nanogpt string Enable NanoGPT Provider (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_enable_vercel string Enable Vercel AI Gateway Provider (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_enable_llmgateway string Enable LLM Gateway Provider (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_enable_ollama string Enable Ollama Provider (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_enable_wellspring string Enable Wellspring Provider (true/false, default false)

// --- Component Enable Toggles ---
//@arg cpm_enable_quick_start string Show Quick Start settings tab (true/false, default true)
//@arg cpm_enable_chat_limiter string Enable Chat Limiter Component (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_chat_navigation string Enable Chat Navigation Component (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_chat_resizer string Enable Chat Input Resizer Component (true/false)
//@arg cpm_enable_copilot string Enable Copilot Manager Component (true/false)
//@arg cpm_nav_click_relay string Enable Android mobile chat-nav click relay (Risu 2026.4.x workaround, default off)
//@arg cpm_enable_storage_manager string Enable Plugin Storage Manager tab (true/false, default false)
//@arg cpm_enable_storage_installed_check string Enable installed-plugin detection in storage manager (true/false, default false)

// --- Global Provider Configs ---
// OpenAI
//@arg cpm_openai_url string OpenAI Base URL
//@arg cpm_openai_key string OpenAI API Key
//@arg cpm_openai_model string OpenAI Model
//@arg cpm_openai_reasoning string OpenAI Reasoning Effort (none, low, medium, high, xhigh)
//@arg cpm_openai_verbosity string OpenAI Verbosity (none, low, medium, high)
//@arg cpm_openai_responses_mode string OpenAI Responses API Mode (auto, on, off)
//@arg cpm_openai_reasoning_continuation string Preserve compatible OpenAI hidden reasoning state across turns (true/false)
//@arg cpm_openai_web_search string OpenAI provider-native web search (off/auto)
//@arg cpm_openai_prompt_cache_retention string OpenAI Prompt Cache Policy (none, in_memory, 24h, off_explicit, explicit_breakpoints)
//@arg cpm_openai_proxy_url string OpenAI CORS Proxy URL
